    `reg 53 — the items the applicant still has to set out or furnish about family allowance months` `I am making the application` `the Minister has asked in writing` `items that apply to my case` `items I have already given`

@export Which items must I still set out or furnish for my application for a division of pensionable earnings (reg 54(1))?
