      `items I have already given` IS A LIST OF `cr2 Item of information relating to the marriage under regulation 54(2)` @desc Which of those items have you already provided?
GIVETH A LIST OF `cr2 Item of information relating to the marriage under regulation 54(2)`
`Which information relating to my marriage is still lacking (reg 54(2))` `items that apply to my case` `items I have already given` MEANS
