GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Must the person or agency paid my benefit on my behalf account to the Minister (reg 55(3))` `my benefit is paid to them on my behalf` MEANS
    `reg 55(3) — the person or agency must account to the Minister for the benefit payments received and the disbursements made` `my benefit is paid to them on my behalf`

-- reg 56: a benefit of less than $2 a month may be paid in arrears at intervals of not more than a year.
