      `an Old Age Security pension is payable to me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a pension then payable to you under the Old Age Security Act?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Can the Minister pay my small benefit in arrears at intervals (reg 56)` `the basic monthly amount` `an Old Age Security pension is payable to me` MEANS
    `reg 56 — the Minister may direct that the benefit be paid in arrears at intervals` `the basic monthly amount` `an Old Age Security pension is payable to me`

