GIVEN `the interval in months` IS A NUMBER @desc How many months is the interval between payments?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Is the interval at which my small benefit is paid no longer than yearly (reg 56)` `the interval in months` MEANS
    `reg 56 — an interval the Minister specifies is not greater than yearly` `the interval in months`

-- reg 57: who may be paid a benefit payment unpaid at the beneficiary's death.
